\newlabel{fig:shortrun}{{5}{9}{Short-run dynamics, means over forty seeds. (a) Average violations from empty knowledge bases. (b) Average violations from 100 periods before the shock at period 1500 (dashed line), when every slot of $\mathcal {C}$ is replaced, to period 2500. (c) Share of agents holding a new clause introduced at the shock, against periods since its introduction, averaged over the new clauses still in $\mathcal {C}$. (d) Share of agents still believing (solid) and disbelieving (dotted) a clause retired at the shock}{figure.5}{}}
